            "fieldType": "description",
            "type": "SET",
            "value": "Max Degree of Change Between \u000bOk-to-Cast and Ok-to-Cut\nHole size: +/- 2mm\nHole position: Within current plane and +/- 4mm\nTrim: +/- 2mm\nFlanges and Form: +/-  5mm\nMating surface: + 5mm\nGage +/- 10%\n\nEP Ok-to-Cut / SBU Ok-to-Cut\n\nAll EP Ok-to-Design and Ok-To-Cast criteria should be met.\nPart costs, both tooling and piece price, is accurate in financial BOM and meets program targets. (If not, a CMF should be generated and approved.)\nPer the definition of P-Release, parts that are P-Released are considered ready for Ok-to-Cut"
